The page sink now reads the data schema of an INSERT through the
content schema provider, as the split manager does. For the file table
description supplier that turned an unreadable schema file from a
KAFKA_SCHEMA_ERROR naming the file into a GENERIC_INTERNAL_ERROR that
called every schema an Avro schema and printed the location as an
Optional. Fail with KAFKA_SCHEMA_ERROR and the location instead.
